        "Id1": {
            "text": "American citizen Darinka Dentcheva was born on January 1st, 1958. After graduating from her alma mater Humboldt University, she began to work professionally in the field of Mathematical Optimization. This New Jersey resident is known for her work with stochastic programming, being heavily influenced by Andrzej Piotr Ruszczynski."
        },
        "Id2": {
            "text": "American mathematician Darinka Dentcheva was born on January 1, 1958. Dentcheva graduated from Humboldt University in Berlin, Germany. Influenced by fellow mathematician, Andrzej Piotr Ruszczy\u0144ski, Dentcheva made contributions to the field of mathematical optimization, in particular, Stochastic programming. She resides in New Jersey."
        },
