            "text": "Darinka Dentcheva, a United States citizen with birth date January 1, 1958 is a mathematician influenced by Andrzej Piotr Ruszczy\u0144ski in the field of mathematical optimization and stochastic programming. She graduated from Humboldt University and resides in New Jersey."
